      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T19:31:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This boolean is effectively unused: it\u0027s a hard-coded true that only appears in a debug log.\n\nDefined in two places (the other one is in the method `getSpectrumAssignment`) but only actually used in one. This one is only used during logging.\n\nHaving the same boolean variable in two places means they must be updated synchronously. If the logic drifts in either method, they might end up silently disagreeing with each other. It would be safer to get rid of having this variable defined in two places.",
      "revId": "5167bbacd05a77e36eb8ad38c77cb5646b443c42",
